### Catalog
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/spp-variables
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/members
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/cycles
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/rehearsal-sessions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/spp-cycles/1/scores

### Create band
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "wave-a-demo",
  "name": "Wave A Demo Band",
  "bandType": "product",
  "sppEnabled": 1,
  "geoCode": "MEX"
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/band-members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bandId": 1,
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "roleInBand": "guitar"
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bandId": 1,
  "notes": "Product console rehearsal"
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-checkins
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rehearsalSessionId": 1,
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "lateMinutes": 0
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/spp-cycles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bandId": 1,
  "code": "WAVE-A-1",
  "status": "open"
}

### Close Q2 (recompute share_bps; expected 3800/3520/2000/680 on seed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/spp-cycles/1/close
